n></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span> 时需评估承载力折减。</p>\n<h3 id=\"加固改造技术\">加固改造技术</h3><p>根据结构缺陷类型和加固目标，选择相应的加固方案：</p>\n<p><strong>增大截面加固法</strong>：在原构件外包一层新混凝土和钢筋，适用于承载力严重不足的情况。</p>\n<p>加固后承载力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>u</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_u^{&#x27;} = f_y A_s (h_0 - \\frac{a&#x27;}{2}) + f_y^{new} A_s^{new} (h_0^{new} - \\frac{a^{new}}{2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">