span></span></span></div><p><strong>粘贴碳纤维（CFRP）加固法</strong>：在构件表面粘贴高强度碳纤维布，提升抗弯/抗剪承载力。</p>\n<p>碳纤维材料参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>抗拉强度：3000-4000 MPa</li>\n<li>弹性模量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.3 \\times 10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> MPa</li>\n<li>厚度：0.111-0.167 mm/层</li>\n<li>极限伸长率：1.5-1.7%</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CFRP抗弯加固承载力增量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta M = \\psi_f E_f \\varepsilon_{fe} A_f (h - \\frac{x}{2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为碳纤维强度利用系数（≤0.85），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{fe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为有效应变，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为碳纤维面积。</p>\n<p><strong>粘钢加固法</strong>：在混凝土表面粘贴钢板，施工快速但增加自重较多。</p>\n<p><strong>各加固方法对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>加固方法</th>\n<th>承载力提升</th>\n<th>自重增加</th>\n<th>施工难度</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增大截面</td>\n<td>30-80%</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碳纤维CFRP</td>\n<td>20-50%</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粘钢</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预应力加固</td>\n<td>40-100%</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外包钢套</td>\n<td>50-100%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"智能化运维-bim-fm\">智能化运维（BIM+FM）</h3><p>建筑运维阶段的时间跨度远超设计和施工阶段之和（通常50年以上），智能运维通过BIM与设施管理系统（FM）集成实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;竣工BIM模型交付&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;运维BIM平台&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;设备台账管理&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;空间管理&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;能耗监测&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;维修工单&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;设备信息卡片&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;巡检计划&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;备件库存&quot;]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;分项计量&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;能耗基线&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[&quot;异常诊断&quot;]&#10;&#10;    F --&gt; F1[&quot;报修受理&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[&quot;调度派工&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F3[&quot;完工确认&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F4[&quot;满意度评价&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"竣工BIM模型交付\"] --&gt; B[\"运维BIM平台\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"设备台账管理\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"空间管理\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"能耗监测\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"维修工单\"]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[\"设备信息卡片\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"巡检计划\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"备件库存\"]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[\"分项计量\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"能耗基线\"]\n    E --&gt; E3[\"异常诊断\"]\n\n    F --&gt; F1[\"报修受理\"]\n    F --&gt; F2[\"调度派工\"]\n    F --&gt; F3[\"完工确认\"]\n    F --&gt; F4[\"满意度评价\"]</pre><p><strong>BIM+FM集成的核心价值</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可视化定位</strong>：点击BIM模型中的设备即可查看运行状态、维护记录</li>\n<li><strong>预测性维护</strong>：基于IoT数据和设备运行时长预测故障概率</li>\n</ol>\n<p>设备故障概率模型（指数分布）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t) = 1 - e^{-\\lambda t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为故障率（1/平均无故障时间MTBF）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t) &gt; 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 时触发预防性维护。</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>能耗智能管控</strong>：AI算法根据天气预报、室内人员密度自动调节空调设定温度</li>\n<li><strong>空间优化</strong>：基于人员流动数据优化功能区布局</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>智慧楼宇关键指标体系</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设备综合效率OEE &gt; 85%</li>\n<li>单位面积能耗 &lt; 基线的85%</li>\n<li>维修响应时间 &lt; 30分钟</li>\n<li>租户满意度 &gt; 90%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"城市更新政策与实践\">城市更新政策与实践</h3><p>中国城市更新政策框架（2021年住建部《关于在实施城市更新行动中防止大拆大建问题的通知》核心原则）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>拆除面积不超过现状总建筑面积的20%</li>\n<li>拆建比不超过2</li>\n<li>就近安置率不低于50%</li>\n<li>保留城市记忆和历史风貌</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>典型城市更新类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>更新类型</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>改造内容</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>老旧小区改造</td>\n<td>2000年前住宅</td>\n<td>外立面/管网/电梯</td>\n<td>6-12个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产业园区转型</td>\n<td>旧厂房</td>\n<td>功能置换/结构加固</td>\n<td>1-2年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史街区保护</td>\n<td>文保建筑</td>\n<td>修缮/活化利用</td>\n<td>2-3年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>城中村整治</td>\n<td>非正规建设</td>\n<td>安全消隐/环境提升</td>\n<td>1-3年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>老旧小区改造的智能化升级内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加装电梯（含BIM精确定位基础开挖位置）</li>\n<li>二次供水泵房智能化改造</li>\n<li>充电桩有序充电管理系统</li>\n<li>社区安防AI摄像头</li>\n<li>管网GIS信息化管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年城市更新领域的技术创新：激光扫描+AI自动生成既有建筑BIM模型（scan-to-BIM）技术已将建模效率提升10倍以上；基于物联网的管网泄漏智能定位系统可在24小时内定位地下管线破损点；装配式加固技术（预制外包钢筋混凝土套）使柱加固工期从2周缩短至3天；数字化房屋体检系统通过传感器持续监测结构健康状态，建立城市级建筑安全数据库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为一栋建成于1990年的6层砖混住宅设计检测方案：确定检测项目、数量和方法，估算检测费用。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某框架梁原始截面300mm×600mm，原配受力筋4根Φ25，现需提升抗弯承载力30%。分别用增大截面法和CFRP法设计加固方案，比较两种方案的优缺点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一套基于BIM+FM的商业综合体运维管理方案，确定平台功能模块和关键绩效指标（KPI）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>调研所在城市的城市更新项目案例，分析其改造策略、技术方案和社会效益。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节从既有建筑检测鉴定的流程和方法入手，详细介绍了增大截面、碳纤维、粘钢等主要加固技术的原理和适用条件，阐述了BIM与设施管理系统集成的智能运维模式，并梳理了城市更新的政策框架和典型实践。城市更新是未来建筑业的主战场之一，智能建造技术在其中具有广阔的应用空间。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"城市更新与智能运维","id":"城市更新与智能运维"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"既有建筑检测鉴定","id":"既有建筑检测鉴定"},{"level":3,"text":"加固改造技术","id":"加固改造技术"},{"level":3,"text":"智能化运维（BIM+FM）","id":"智能化运维-bim-fm"},{"level":3,"text":"城市更新政策与实践","id":"城市更新政策与实践"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"绿色建筑评价标准","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/green-prefabricated-building/green-building-standards"},"next":null}